  "title": "Cold Yogurt Soup (Abdoogh Khiar)",
  "description": "This icy cold yogurt soup (abdoogh khiar) recipe is a refreshing Persian blend of Greek yogurt, cucumbers, walnuts, raisins, fresh mint, and parsley.",
